          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Muntu' u'yo ali'leta ki'taambo cha kwiswanania ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yi'lamudime afumye lwandi' lwacho ku'fuma ku' ki'taambo cheni'cho ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alalete kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' makono gakwe mweni'ki'li'. Alalete maguta ga yeni'yo ndimu haki'mo na ki'dali, nawe alaki'wu'sye ki'v'e lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'mufumi'zya kalu'mbi'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhozya alagazigye maguta gose ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, ali'vi ki'dali ki'lav'e chamwa Aloni na v'aane v'a ki'gosya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itango lya ndimu lya ku' mulyi'la lya ki'taambo cha kwiswanania mulamupe muhozya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaani mwana wamwa Aloni u'yo alav'e ali'wegezya magazi na maguta ga ki'taambo cha kwiswanania hu' mwene alapiwe itango lyeni'lo lya mulyi'la ku'v'a ifungu lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'fuma ku' ki'la ki'taambo cha kwiswanania cha V'aizilaeli, ene Mulungu nasolaga ki'dali i'cho chawu'siv'agwa haki'mo na i'lo itango i'lo lyafumiv'agwa, nanne nav'apaga v'ahozya, Aloni na v'aane ku'v'a ifungu lyav'o lya nhananhana ku'fuma ku' V'aizilaeli.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwenu'lu' hu' lwandi' lwa kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya kamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu u'lo lwakomwa ku'nguno yamwa Aloni na v'aane, ku'fuma lu'siku' u'lo ndi' v'ali'simi'kwa ku'nguno ya ku'mutu'mami'la Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' u'lo ndi' v'ali'v'ilwa maguta, Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' walagi'li'zya ati', V'aizilaeli v'av'ape lyeni'li' ku'v'a ifungu lyav'o lya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa wav'o u'wo wu'lalonde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zyeni'zyo hu' nhama zya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo, ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya musango, ki'taambo cha ku'simi'ki'la v'ahozya, na ki'taambo cha kwiswanania, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i'zyo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamupa Mose ku' igu'lya na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, lu'siku' u'lo ndi' wav'alagi'li'zya V'aizilaeli v'alete kalu'mbi'lo kav'o ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku' ibalangu' lya Sinai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
